// zanac.rc.in - Windows resources of the Zanac C port.
//
// CMake substitutes @ZANAC_ICON_PATH@ with the absolute path of zanac.ico:
// rc.exe looks for INCLUDE files relative to its working directory, not to the
// .rc file, so a relative name would depend on how the build was started.
//
// The first icon in the executable is the one Explorer, the taskbar and Alt-Tab
// show.  The SDL window icon is set separately at run time from
// frontend/icon.h (same picture, rendered as RGBA).
1 ICON "@ZANAC_ICON_PATH@"
